      "facts": [
        "One of the viewer's sites and its listing: `GET /community/sites`, and what listing one from the Sites page answers (`POST /community/sites/:id`). `live` is shown; `pending` waits for its review; `held` did not pass it; `hidden` is a site not published now. A site with none is not listed.",
        "Hosts served by our own preview edge (`cloud-preview-edge/`), for sandbox providers whose edge cannot ask us who is calling. A preview there is `pv-<chat key>-<generation>.<domain>`, authorised per request by the Cloud API exactly as a Freestyle preview is.",
        "The label `previewEdgeHost` builds: a chat key, a provider, a generation id.",
        "Whether one DNS label is a preview edge label.",
        "The edge domain a hostname belongs to, or null when it is not a preview edge host.",
        "Whether a hostname is an Agent 37 embed link's."
